Required dependencies
=====================

SymLean requires two libraries, which Lake fetches when it builds SymLean; neither is bundled
here. FloatLib (https://github.com/lean-dojo/FloatLib, 3.1.0 at 0fe4f04) is released under the MIT
License, and Mathlib (https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4, v4.35.0) under the
Apache License 2.0.

